<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico livestock export update -USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico livestock export update -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of New Mexico exports to Mexico, to April 26 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     351	     8,923	 N/A</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	 N/A</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females   301	     2,311	 N/A</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females   271	     2,007	 N/A</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
